{"title":"Sael Quickstring","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Sael Quickstring is a named <a href=\"#/monster/dune-skirmisher\">Dune Skirmisher</a> seen at level 40 (archer).</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Where to find Sael Quickstring</h2>\n      \n      <ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Wind-Carved%20Rocks\">Wind-Carved Rocks</a></li></ul>\n      \n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"npc\" data-map-id=\"sael-quickstring\">Show on map</button>\n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra\"><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"arrow\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/f8e0f872cc502e1dabe7.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Arrow</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">2 drops</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"dune-whetstone\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/856bbd4f9ab72fa1ff47.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dune Whetstone</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"black-walnut-crossbow\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/9eb6bfca42dff868e02b.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Black Walnut Crossbow</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop</span></div></div></div>\n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/491a153af36e89ea9f44.webp\" alt=\"\"></div><h3>Sael Quickstring</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Kind</th><td><a href=\"#/monster/dune-skirmisher\">Dune Skirmisher</a></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>40</td></tr><tr><th>Class</th><td>archer</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>582</td></tr><tr><th>Seen</th><td>38 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}